# Added by Constructor Studio (CONTRACT-sync.md §6): .studio/ itself is
# committed on purpose, but these two paths are local-only or derived and
# carry no reviewable information — history-store.js keeps 200 full
# snapshots per document, and changes/index.json is a derived cache whose
# own header says so. Never remove a line here, and never negate .studio/.
# This is an append-only, per-author log of who added what and why — add to
# it, do not rewrite it.
.studio/history/
.studio/changes/index.json
